  "prompt": "Which products are in the cheaper half of their category by unit cost, for the TV & Video categories (category_id from 1 to 6, both included)? Sort each category's products from the lowest unit cost up and split them into two halves; when a category has an odd number of products, the cheaper half holds one more. When products of a category tie on unit cost, the lower product_id comes first. Return three columns, in this order: category_id, product_id and unit_cost_eur. Return one row for each product in a cheaper half. Any row order is fine.",
